# T001 citywide overview-tier census work root: stage receipts only. Every
# measurement the decision rests on is committed under
# data/citywide-overview-census-20260814/ with its own checksum sidecar, so the
# evidence stays checkable after this worktree-local tree is removed. The census
# is census-only and retains no geometry, so there is nothing else here.
artifacts/citywide-overview-census-20260814/

# T004 Blender-agreement work root: the per-sample analytic inputs, the
# selection table and the raw Blender inspection report. Every number the
# agreement rests on — the sample list, the deterministic selection rule, each
# building's measured deltas and each measured file's checksum — is committed in
# data/mass-generation-20260816/blender-agreement.json with its own sidecar, so
# the evidence stays checkable after this worktree-local tree is removed. No
# geometry and no render is retained here.
artifacts/mass-generation-20260816/

# T002 far-tier bake work root: the prototype tile, its atlas, the regenerated
# and checksum-verified source assets the Blender instrument renders, and the
# stills themselves. Nothing here is retained: the tile is a DERIVATIVE of
# retention-only assets and carries the narrower envelope, so it stays local by
# construction. Every number the prototype rests on — both replay digests, the
# provenance chain, and every measured agreement reading with its pre-registered
# bar — is committed under data/far-tier-hlod-20260818/ with checksum sidecars,
# so the evidence stays checkable after this worktree-local tree is removed.
artifacts/far-tier-hlod-20260818/

# T010 recipe-v2 work root: the decomposition subjects (variant GLBs with one
# surface class blacked out), their linear EXR stills, and the atlas they share.
# None of it is retained: the variants are instrumentation that must never be
# served, and the tile they derive from is itself a derivative of retention-only
# assets. Every number the Stage A census and the Stage B halt rest on is
# committed under data/far-tier-hlod-v2-20260818/ with checksum sidecars.
artifacts/far-tier-hlod-v2-20260818/

# T011 far-tier v3 work root: the ablation subjects (shipped emission with
# plan.prisms emptied) and their linear EXR stills. The ablated assets carry the
# UN-ablated plan's planHashSha256 and must never be served; they are
# instrumentation on the T010 black-conductor precedent. Every number the
# Stage 0a halt rests on is committed under data/far-tier-hlod-v3-20260818/.
artifacts/far-tier-hlod-v3-20260818/

# T012 instrument-pin work root: the generated assertion harness, the hypothesis
# sweep renders and the pinned baseline stills. The harness is regenerated from
# src/release/far-tier-instrument.ts on demand and its sha256 is committed in
# data/far-tier-hlod-instrument-20260818/pinned-instrument-spec.json, so nothing
# here is evidence that is not also committed.
artifacts/far-tier-instrument-20260818/

# T003 far-tier runtime work root: Stage 0 spike screenshots and scratch. The
# spike's numbers are committed in data/far-tier-hlod-runtime-20260818/ with a
# checksum sidecar; the harness itself is committed and re-runnable.
artifacts/far-tier-runtime-20260818/
artifacts/far-tier-hlod-20260818/

# T013 far-tier hue attribution work root: the twelve pinned-instrument EXRs,
# the six shadows-off ablation EXRs, the absorbed-material INSTRUMENTATION
# variant assets, and the generated pinned harness. Every one of those bytes is
# digested into data/far-tier-hlod-hue-20260819/pinned-capture.json, which is
# the committed artifact. The variant assets are instrumentation and must never
# be mistaken for a release or a proposed recipe.
artifacts/far-tier-hlod-hue-20260819/

# T004 mass-bake campaign work root: the island's baked tiles and atlases, the
# v4 Stage 0 prototype, and every appearance render. Roughly 280 MB of local
# work product under an approved operator gate. The committed artifacts are the
# per-wave inventories, telemetry and campaign records under
# data/far-tier-hlod-mass-20260819/, each with a checksum sidecar.
artifacts/far-tier-hlod-mass-20260819/
